{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>The memory of the righteous</b> — May HaShem remember him on account of His blessing that comes upon him, as in: \"YHWH, remember us, bless us\" (Psalms 115:12). And the meaning: may He remember him and bless him." "<b>will rot</b> — It will be forgotten like a rotting tree, of no use."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "Resolved ה' to YHWH per the quoted verse from Psalms."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:49.667675387Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}